{"id":66650,"date":"2026-09-03T19:52:16","date_gmt":"2026-09-03T18:52:16","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=66650"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:45:12","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:45:12","slug":"sao-silvestre-baia-do-seixal","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-baia-do-seixal\/","title":{"rendered":"VIII S\u00e3o Silvestre Ba\u00eda do Seixal 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">VIII S\u00e3o Silvestre Ba\u00eda do Seixal 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>VIII S\u00e3o Silvestre Ba\u00eda do Seixal 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>19 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, ao final da tarde, tendo como palco central o <strong>Cais do Mundet<\/strong> (junto ao restaurante Lisboa \u00e0 Vista), em plena frente ribeirinha da <strong>Ba\u00eda do Seixal<\/strong> (concelho do <strong>Seixal<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Set\u00fabal<\/strong>). O programa desportivo abre \u00e0s <strong>16:45<\/strong> com a <strong>Corrida Kids<\/strong>, seguindo-se a partida da <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>17:30<\/strong> e da <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>17:35<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com limite m\u00e1ximo de 5.000 participantes e tempo limite de <strong>2 horas<\/strong>, o percurso acompanha o espelho de \u00e1gua do estu\u00e1rio do Tejo na hist\u00f3rica <strong>Ba\u00eda do Seixal<\/strong> \u2014 outrora marcada pela ind\u00fastria corticeira da Mundet e pelos estaleiros navais, hoje transformada num dos mais amplos passeios ribeirinhos da Margem Sul com vista panor\u00e2mica sobre Lisboa. A prova principal de <strong>10 km<\/strong> disp\u00f5e de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica RFID e abastecimento l\u00edquido ao km 5, enquanto a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> convida fam\u00edlias e grupos a celebrar a \u00e9poca natal\u00edcia sem car\u00e1cter competitivo. Podes calcular os teus ritmos na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e consultar mais <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\">corridas de 10 km em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela <strong>WeRun<\/strong> em conjunto com o <strong>Centro Cultural e Recreativo do Alto do Moinho (CCRAM)<\/strong>, contando com a parceria institucional da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal do Seixal<\/strong>, da Uni\u00e3o das Freguesias do Seixal, Arrentela e Aldeia de Paio Pires e das Juntas de Freguesia de Amora, Corroios e Fern\u00e3o Ferro.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">19 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Cais do Mundet, Ba\u00eda do Seixal, Set\u00fabal<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Di