tyle=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora:<\/strong> 14.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (numer\u00e1rio)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida Kids<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 19 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:45<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Gratuito<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando, onde e a que horas se realiza a VIII S\u00e3o Silvestre Ba\u00eda do Seixal 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A <strong>VIII S\u00e3o Silvestre Ba\u00eda do Seixal<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>19 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida e chegada no <strong>Cais do Mundet<\/strong> (junto ao restaurante Lisboa \u00e0 Vista), na Ba\u00eda do Seixal. A <strong>Corrida Kids<\/strong> parte \u00e0s <strong>16:45<\/strong>, a <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>17:30<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>17:35<\/strong>, com cerim\u00f3nia de entrega de pr\u00e9mios marcada para as 18:45.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para as v\u00e1rias dist\u00e2ncias?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> os valores s\u00e3o de <strong>11,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (at\u00e9 31 de outubro), <strong>13,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (at\u00e9 1 de dezembro), <strong>15,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (at\u00e9 12 de dezembro) e <strong>17,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (\u00faltima hora em numer\u00e1rio). Na <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> custam <strong>8,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (at\u00e9 31 de outubro), <strong>10,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (at\u00e9 1 de dezembro), <strong>12,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (at\u00e9 12 de dezembro) e <strong>14,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (\u00faltima hora). A <strong>Corrida Kids<\/strong> \u00e9 <strong>gratuita<\/strong> desde que a crian\u00e7a v\u00e1 acompanhada por um familiar pagante.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 entregue o kit de atleta e dorsal?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A recolha do kit realiza-se em tr\u00eas momentos: na quinta-feira, <strong>17 de dezembro<\/strong> (12:00 \u00e0s 18:00), na <strong>DS - Decis\u00f5es e Solu\u00e7\u00f5es<\/strong> junto \u00e0 esta\u00e7\u00e3o do Fogueteiro; na sexta-feira, <strong>18 de dezembro<\/strong> (12:00 \u00e0s 18:30), na <strong>Matrizauto de Almada<\/strong>; e no dia da prova, <strong>19 de dezembro<\/strong> (12:30 \u00e0s 16:30), junto \u00e0 partida no <strong>Cais do Mundet<\/strong> (exclusivamente para atletas provenientes de fora do distrito de Set\u00fabal).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9mios e escal\u00f5es da Corrida de 10 km?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os 3 primeiros classificados da Geral Masculina e Feminina nos 10 km recebem trof\u00e9us e cart\u00f5es presente de <strong>150 \u20ac (1\u00ba lugar)<\/strong>, <strong>100 \u20ac (2\u00ba lugar)<\/strong> e <strong>50 \u20ac (3\u00ba lugar)<\/strong>. S\u00e3o tamb\u00e9m premiados os 5 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o et\u00e1rio (Juniores\/Seniores 18-34 e Veteranos I a VIII dos 35 aos 70+ anos), as 5 primeiras equipas e a maior equipa. Todos os finalistas recebem medalha finisher, \u00e1gua, bebida isot\u00f3nica e fruta.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza a VIII S\u00e3o Silvestre Ba\u00eda do Seixal?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela <strong>WeRun<\/strong> em conjunto com o <strong>Centro Cultural e Recreativo do Alto do Moinho<\/strong>, em parceria com a C\u00e2mara Municipal do Seixal e as Juntas de Freguesia do Seixal, Arrentela e Paio Pires, Amora, Corroios e Fern\u00e3o Ferro.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"VIII S\u00e3o Silvestre Ba\u00eda do Seixal 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-19\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-19\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Seixal, Set\u00fabal\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Seixal\", \"addressRegion\": \"Set\u00fabal\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A VIII S\u00e3o Silvestre Ba\u00eda do Seixal 2026 realiza-se a 19 de dezembro no Seixal (Set\u00fabal). Corrida de 10 km, caminhada de 5 km e Kids. Garante j\u00e1 o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-sao-silvestre-baia-do-seixal-4.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida 10 km\", \"price\": \"11.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/werun.pt\/eventos\/viii-sao-silvestre-baia-do-seixal-2026\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"